These are Gysin maps $\pi^!$, and hence by the Gysin sequence, their kernels coincide (respectively) with the images of:
\begin{align} H^{\bullet-2}_{S^1,\mathrm{vir}}(K;A)_{IJ}&\xrightarrow{\cap e}H^\bullet_{S^1,\mathrm{vir}}(K;A)_{IJ}\\ H^{\bullet-2}_{S^1,\mathrm{vir}}(K\operatorname{rel}\partial;A)_{IJ}&\xrightarrow{\cap e}H^\bullet_{S^1,\mathrm{vir}}(K\operatorname{rel}\partial;A)_{IJ}
